ent-BikeHorn = 自行車喇叭 | bike horn
    .desc = 一隻自行車的喇叭。 | A horn off of a bicycle.
ent-CluwneHorn = 壞掉的自行車喇叭 | broken bike horn
    .desc = 一隻從自行車上斷下的車鈴。 | A broken horn off of a bicycle.
ent-GoldenBikeHorn = 金鵝 | golden honker
    .desc = 一聲歡快的喇叭聲，就是獎品，祈求諸神賜予你獎賞吧。 | A happy honk prize, pray to the gods for your reward.
ent-BananiumHorn = 香蕉礦石角 | bananium horn
    .desc = 一款由香蕉礦石製成的氣喇叭。 | An air horn made from bananium.
ent-PushHorn = 按鈕喇叭 | push horn
    .desc = 這款強勁的自行車喇叭，絕對能讓那些皺眉的表情一掃而空。 | This powerful bikehorn is sure to blast frowns away.
ent-BaseWhistle = 哨聲 | whistle
    .desc = 是有人忘了關水壺嗎？ | Someone forgot to turn off a kettle?
ent-Whistle = { ent-BaseWhistle }
    .desc = { ent-BaseWhistle.desc }
ent-SecurityWhistle = { ent-BaseWhistle }
    .desc = 光是聽見這個聲音就令人感到恐懼。 | The sound of it brings fear.
ent-SyndicateWhistle = 戰壕哨 | trench whistle
    .desc = 辛迪加指揮官用來引起注意的哨子。前進！ | A whistle used by Syndicate commanders to draw attention. Avanti!
