    .desc = { ent-BaseItem.desc }
ent-ToyRubberDuck = 橡皮鴨 | rubber ducky
    .desc = 並非由洋流帶到此處。 | Not carried here by ocean currents.
ent-RubberChicken = 橡皮雞 | rubber chicken
    .desc = 一部以大自然中最美味的鳥類為題材、令人感到壓力的惡搞作品。 | A stress inducing parody of nature's most delectable avian.
ent-NewtonCradle = 牛頓擺 | newton cradle
    .desc = 一種讓無聊的文員用來提醒自己「時間還沒停下來」的裝置。內含重力。 | A device bored paper pushers use to remind themselves that time did not stop yet. Contains gravity.
ent-ClownRecorder = 小丑竖笛 | clown recorder
    .desc = 當你實在無法自然地逗人發笑的時候！ | When you just can't get those laughs coming the natural way!
ent-WhoopieCushion = 放屁墊 | whoopie cushion
    .desc = 一種以放屁幽默為主題的惡作劇裝置。 | A practical joke device involving flatulence humour.
ent-Skub = skub | skub
    .desc = 斯庫布是第五位混沌之神。 | Skub is the fifth Chaos God.
